# What bash, Python and Docker read reaches them with LF, whatever the machine's git settings (core.autocrlf on
# Windows): the local bee's launcher, its tool and its image are run from a checkout of this repository.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Dockerfile.* text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz binary
